{"id":"0f48822de2ded7de","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-infinite-injury.md","title":"Infinite Injury","display":"df-infinite-injury — Infinite Injury","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-infinite-injury","aliases":["68-df-infinite-injury"],"display":"df-infinite-injury — Infinite Injury","depends_on":["[[68-df-priority-argument]]","[[68-df-finite-injury]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework","verification_status":"local-framework-definition","source_proof_status":"not-a-book-theorem","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-infinite-injury"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-infinite-injury</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinite-injury — Infinite Injury"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" href=\"?note=1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" title=\"68-df-priority-argument\">68-df-priority-argument</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75703316b975a2ec\" href=\"?note=75703316b975a2ec\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury\">68-df-finite-injury</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-framework-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-book-theorem"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inj}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inj}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_b\">\\(I_b\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" href=\"?note=1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" title=\"68-df-priority-argument\">68-df-priority-argument</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75703316b975a2ec\" href=\"?note=75703316b975a2ec\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury\">68-df-finite-injury</a>；仍采用较高优先行动重置的固定接口。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfInjury}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfInjury}\\)</span> 为以下引入的无限伤害谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\ge s_0\\;\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InfInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\ge s_0\\;\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(I_b(e,s)\\ge k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InfInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(I_b(e,s)\\ge k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该性质只说某策略受伤无穷次，不把“全部要求最终满足”混入伤害定义。原节点将 Sat(R_e,s) 与 Sat(R_e,A_s) 混用，并把成功当作无限伤害的组成部分；两处均移除。无限伤害的成功构造还需结局、真路径或其他具体机制，原书没有此抽象谓词，不能单凭本定义推导 Sacks 方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-priority-argument","status":"resolved","id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-argument]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-finite-injury","status":"resolved","id":"75703316b975a2ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-priority-argument","status":"resolved","id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Inj}$ 与 $I_b$ 见 [[68-df-priority-argument]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]；仍采用较高优先行动重置的固定接口。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-finite-injury","status":"resolved","id":"75703316b975a2ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Inj}$ 与 $I_b$ 见 [[68-df-priority-argument]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]；仍采用较高优先行动重置的固定接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inj}","display":false},{"tex":"I_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfInjury}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\ge s_0\\;\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(I_b(e,s)\\ge k).","display":true}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-infinite-injury|df-infinite-injury — Infinite Injury]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-infinite-injury]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-infinite-injury|df-infinite-injury — Infinite Injury]]"}],"outgoing":["1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","75703316b975a2ec"]}